格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"[dsh]为纯文本模型设计更强大的视觉工具箱：一行安装使用、粘贴图片直接识别、多张图片问答、截图到前端UI 还原等｜DeepSeek Harness-native integration for agent-vision-toolkit: image Q&A, long-screenshot OCR, UI restoration, grounding, pixel diff, Artifacts, and Web UI.","id":"gh:1333100071","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-vision-toolkit","slug":"Anionex/dsh-vision-toolkit","topics":["agent-skills","agent-vision-toolkit","computer-vision","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","gui-automation","ocr","plugin","python","screenshot-testing","text-only-llm","typescript","ui-restoration","vision-language-model","vision-tools"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"[dsh]为纯文本模型设计更强大的视觉工具箱：一行安装使用、粘贴图片直接识别、多张图片问答、截图到前端UI 还原等｜DeepSeek Harness-native integration for ag"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ent-vision-toolkit: image Q&A, long-screenshot OCR, UI restoration, grounding, pixel diff, Artifacts"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"olkit: image Q&A, long-screenshot OCR, UI restoration, grounding, pixel diff, Artifacts, and Web UI."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Vision Toolkit"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**A more powerful vision toolkit—give text-only models in DeepSeek Harness eyes: image Q&A;, long-sc"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"reenshot OCR, UI restoration, and GUI visual tasks in one toolkit and Skill.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"🚀 Paste an image and ask directly | Install with one command | Broad use cases"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Highlights | Quick start | Toolbox | Configuration and limits | Troubleshooting | Community"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"🌐 **English** | 中文"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"🏆 This project is the first comprehensive vision-tool plugin in the DeepSeek Harness ecosystem: it w"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"as initiated before internal beta and built during the beta with reference to `agent-vision-toolkit`"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"s initiated before internal beta and built during the beta with reference to `agent-vision-toolkit`."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"> **Original work:** The system and division of responsibilities behind these visual tools, together"},{"id":"p8s2","text":" with the `vision-skills` Skill, were personally created and continuously refined by the author thro"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"ugh long-term real-world use and repeated iteration."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"> If this project helps you or gives you some inspiration, feel free to star 🌟 & fork."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Highlights"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- **Paste an image and ask directly.** In DSH Web, pasting an image switches the text-only model to "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"its `(Vision Toolkit)` variant automatically — no manual path copying or model changes. Native thumb"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"nails, session history, and workspace paths stay intact; Web can preview artifacts.\n- **One command "},{"id":"p11s4","text":"to install.** After installation, configure a vision provider in **Settings → Vision Toolkit** and s"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"tart using the tools.\n- **Not just a caption — the content that matters.** The model does not produc"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"e a generic description; it extracts evidence around the current task, such as “Where is the error?”"},{"id":"p11s7","text":" or “Where is the button?”.\n- **A battle-tested visual-task methodology.** The bundled Skill tells t"},{"id":"p11s8","text":"he agent what to look at for different visual tasks, which tool to choose, how to proceed, and how t"},{"id":"p11s9","text":"o verify the result."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"`agent-vision-toolkit` gives an agent more than image captions: it can read, locate, crop, trace, re"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"build, and verify visual work. DSH Vision Toolkit is its native DeepSeek Harness integration, bringi"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"ng that workflow into Web and Headless Profiles."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"This project has two layers:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"1. **Visual tools and a Skill:** the agent learns when to inspect, ground, OCR, crop, trace, or comp"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"are pixels.\n2. **Native DSH integration:** those capabilities live inside Profiles, sessions, Settin"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"gs, Artifacts, and the Web UI."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**Upstream toolkit:** Anionex/agent-vision-toolkit · **Project website:** agent-vision.anionex.me"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Recent updates"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- **2026-08-20 · AIHubMix setup guide:** Added a screenshot-based guide for getting an API key throu"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"gh the Inferera entry and configuring the Gemini 3.7 Flash vision model; Settings now links directly"},{"id":"p18s3","text":" to this guide.\n- **2026-08-19 · Transparent routing by default:** The model selector keeps one entr"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"y per model with the original name, and image input (paste, history, `read_image`) works without man"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"ually switching to a `(Vision Toolkit)` variant. Disable “Transparent variant routing” in advanced s"},{"id":"p18s6","text":"ettings → image input to restore the explicit entries.\n- **2026-08-16 · Windows Python:** Added Micr"},{"id":"p18s7","text":"osoft Store Python support, fixing first-time isolated-runtime setup failures for affected Windows u"},{"id":"p18s8","text":"sers.\n- **2026-08-17 · Vision upgrade:** Switched the default model to Gemini 3.7 Flash and fixed Qw"},{"id":"p18s9","text":"en/Gemini bounding-box coordinate order.\n- **2026-08-16 · Image paste:** Text-only routes now switch"},{"id":"p18s10","text":" to a `(Vision Toolkit)` variant and keep a workspace path, fixing blocked pastes and images that co"},{"id":"p18s11","text":"uld not be reused later.\n- **2026-08-16 · Service stability:** Expanded service capacity to reduce p"},{"id":"p18s12","text":"eak-time `429` responses.\n- **2026-08-16 · Real model test:** Added a full image-request test in Set"},{"id":"p18s13","text":"tings, fixing the false confidence caused by a successful `/models` request to a model that still ca"},{"id":"p18s14","text":"nnot process images."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Who it is for"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"1. Want an interaction experience similar to a multimodal model: paste an image directly and ask a q"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"uestion or make a request.\n2. Want more than image Q&A; — complete more complex, high-value visual t"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"asks such as turning a sketch into a front-end page, converting an image into HTML, or extracting ch"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"at messages from long screenshots; more scenarios are added over time."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The bundled `vision-skills` Skill carries the complete upstream playbooks, explaining when to use ea"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ch workflow, in what order to call the tools, and how to verify the result:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Playbook | What the agent learns to do |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Read long screenshots, chat histories, and scrolling pages | Find low-content cut bands, OCR each "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"chunk in order, preserve chat speakers/timestamps/quotes, merge only duplicated overlap, and surface"},{"id":"p23s3","text":" risky boundaries for verification |\n| Rebuild a UI from a screenshot or design | Reuse project comp"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"onents and assets first, then combine code-native UI, extracted visuals, rendered screenshots, and v"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"isual comparison to align a page or component |\n| Restore an icon, logo, illustration, or other grap"},{"id":"p23s6","text":"hic | Extract a transparent PNG from the source image, or rebuild an editable/scalable SVG when need"},{"id":"p23s7","text":"ed, then verify shape, color, and alpha edges |\n| Turn a sketch, diagram, or whiteboard into structu"},{"id":"p23s8","text":"red code | Recover nodes, labels, connections, and directions as editable Mermaid, Graphviz, or anot"},{"id":"p23s9","text":"her structured representation |\n| Operate a GUI from screenshots | Locate a control, perform one act"},{"id":"p23s10","text":"ion, capture the screen again, and verify the resulting state before continuing |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## See it in action"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### Paste an image directly into DSH"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"*Paste an image into the conversation. A text-only model can switch to its `Vision Toolkit` variant "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"and inspect the image in the context of the user's question.*"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The plugin keeps image understanding and deterministic local image processing in one Agent workflow."},{"id":"p28s2","text":" The diagram below shows the implementation boundary."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
